# No server environment variables are currently required.
#
# The site is fully static: the "get involved" and "contact" paths are plain
# WhatsApp/email links, and donations are an outbound link to PayPal's hosted
# page. None of these need a secret.
#
# If a server-side integration returns later (e.g. a form that emails, or a
# CAPTCHA), document its variables here, keep real values in `.dev.vars`
# (gitignored) for local dev, and set them as Cloudflare Pages env vars in
# production. Never commit real values.
